WEBVTT

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.520
I baked madeleines for today.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.860
They're packed with love and courage,
so they should be good.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.080
Here. Open wide.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.660
Can I say something first?

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.620
Certainly.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.460
As requested,
I've been coming to the library

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.840
every day during lunch
and after school, right?

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.760
Yes. And I'm delighted
that you've been indulging me like this.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.810
Then, don't you think
you should also indulge me?

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.890
I suppose I should. All right.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.070
Here. Go ahead.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.700
Huh?

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.540
Go ahead. Lick it.
It's your favorite today.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.200
I'm not licking that!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.410
My favorite is boobs!

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:07.290
With your true form...

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.250
I want to squee in that big-boobed,
beautiful girl I'm not in love with!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.720
You're the embodiment of lust.
So disappointing.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.510
I'm the one who's disappointed!

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.970
Every day, I have to face this braided,
bifocaled, butt-ugly wench!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:23.020
I'm seriously at the end of my rope!

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.390
I have my reasons.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.890
Reasons?

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.860
There is a demon who is after me.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:35.150
So that I can walk these lands, I must hide
from the demon by disguising myself like this.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:37.660
Calm down. We're still only on episode four.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.490
It's too early to prop up the series
with an another-world battle arc.

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.080
There's one more thing.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:42.990
What?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.250
I'm not too pleased with your reason
for coming here every day.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:24.970
EPISODE 04
THE RESULTS OF MY HARD WORK

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.220
I've been coming as promised.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.310
This isn't a hideout.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.850
Everyone's misunderstandings about you
have been cleared up.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:33.060
But there are people who are still broken.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.480
That's why you've been coming here,

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:39.240
so you can avoid
being in the same place as them.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.200
Oh, shut up.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.490
Joro, how long do you mean
to avoid reconciling with them?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.370
It's none of your business.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:53.670
Oh. You'd like to be friends again with them,
but can't just seem to find the opportunity yet.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.840
Opportunity is simple.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.420
All you have to do is say something.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:05.850
Look, there's no way
they'd want to have anything to do with me.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.640
The effort to search for a reason
not to do something never bears fruit.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:12.600
I'm going back to the classroom.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:13.440
Wait.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.810
Let go. I hate you.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.770
That's it!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:23.610
What I love about you is your honesty, Joro.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.740
If you're like how you are now
and honestly tell them how you feel,

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.500
I'm sure they'll understand.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.660
Even now, when we're totally on the outs?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:39.550
If it's that bad, then no matter what you do,
it can't get any worse.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.510
It's better to have many friends.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.550
Without them, it's lonely.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.300
Are you speaking from experience?

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.680
If that's what you think, I don't mind.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.810
Then, you put in some effort
to make friends, too!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.660
Was it good?

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.000
I have one more reason to come here now.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.790
That's a sweet reason.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.670
All right. I'm going to do it.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.760
Um, first...

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.970
Joro! Can I talk to you for a minute?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.430
What's up, Asunaro?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.520
<i>This is Hina Hanetachi.</i>

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.940
HINA HANETACHI(16)
NICKNAME: ASUNARO

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.350
<i>Her nickname comes
from her name the other way around,</i>

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:45.280
ASUNARO

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:40.900
<i>minus the first and last characters
and then tweaking one.</i>

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.150
<i>She's an ace reporter
for the school newspaper</i>

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.690
<i>and has a scary information network.</i>

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.740
Actually, I'm taking a survey
about the Flower Festival,

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.530
and I'd love to have your help.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:53.290
Flower Festival?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:58.420
It's just displays
that none of the classes are into, right?

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:03.460
Not quite! There's one event
that draws everyone's attention!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.670
The Flower Dance?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.670
Exactly!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:10.930
The dance event in which one boy dances
with three female partners, one after another!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.310
Legend has it that the boy
chosen for the Flower Dance

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.890
will end up getting married
to one of the three chosen girls!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.690
It's our school's greatest event!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.940
<i>Who is she explaining it to?</i>

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.700
The boy is chosen in a drawing,
but the girls are nominated, right?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:32.070
So please tell me
which girls you think will be chosen!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.030
Well...

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.290
I can't think of anyone but you, Asunaro.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.500
Ain't no way anybody'd pick me!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.590
You got me.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.880
It's better to go with your native dialect
than trying to fit in.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.890
Besides, I don't get to hear
Tsugaru dialect every day.

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.600
I disagree!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.850
So who do you really think?

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.350
Besides me!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.150
Well, let's see.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:04.860
Usually it would be girls
who are especially popular.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.650
I don't get it!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.200
Maybe someone who's suffering
from studying for the midterm.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.320
Oh, I see.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.580
Damn it! It's like there are no outs
and the bases are loaded.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.660
I've suspected you of having that preference
for some time now.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.080
Not him!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.670
I'm kidding!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.630
What a mess. At this rate,
I'll have to take supplementary lessons!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.380
Maybe it would be better
if someone helped me.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.640
<i>I didn't think I'd get a chance
to make up so soon.</i>

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:38.720
<i>All right!</i>

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.520
Then, I'll take a look!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:44.860
<i>Maybe I'll have a chance later.</i>

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:49.150
<i>The effort to search for a reason
not to do something never bears fruit.</i>

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.370
Asunaro, are you sure?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.200
Yes, of course!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.540
What part don't you get—

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.790
Hey, may I?

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:02.290
What's wrong, Joro?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.750
Look, if Himawari needs help, I—

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.290
Himawari, wait!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.760
Wait, I said!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:10.880
Damn it! You won't get...

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.760
Ow!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.350
Are you okay, Himawari?!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.640
No, I'm not okay! It hurts!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.850
It wouldn't have happened
if you didn't chase me!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.060
S-Sorry.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:26.900
Jeez!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.280
From now on, be more careful!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.650
Well, I'll be on my way!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:31.990
Um, wait!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.700
Let go of me!
I've caused you enough trouble!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.620
If we're together, I'll just
cause you more trouble, so let go!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.370
I don't think of you as a troublemaker!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.290
That can't be true! Liar!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.250
I apologize for causing you all that trouble,
but you're a jerk, too!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.080
You're plenty bad!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.260
That's why I wanted to apologize
and make up!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.670
Can't you even understand that,
you airhead?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.470
I can't believe how stupid you are!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.970
I'm not stupid!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:00.430
I wanted to make up with you all this time,
but I didn't know what to do!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.930
You're the stupid one, Joro!
Stupid for not understanding!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.730
That's insulting.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.150
In that case, like it or not, I'm going
to make up with you, so prepare yourself!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.030
Hey, Himawari.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.240
Um, what?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.700
Uh, can we be friends again?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:26.290
I want to! I want to be friends
with you again, Joro! Definitely!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:29.960
Whoa! Hey!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.510
I was so relieved, that my body went slack.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.430
Joro! Joro! Joro!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.310
<i>Bitch. Bitch. Bitch.</i>

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.650
Well, I'm glad we're back to normal. Also...

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.480
let's start studying together.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.780
Great! I'll do my best!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.570
One more thing, Himawari.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:58.490
I'd like your help with something.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:00.780
What is it?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.200
Actually...

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.660
Jeez.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:09.670
You pulled me out of lunch to come up here.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:14.420
CHALLENGE

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:15.550
A letter of challenge. That's cute, Joro.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.880
CHALLENGE

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.010
Don't back away!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.190
So?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.600
What kind of challenge are we talking?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.400
If it's baseball, let's go to the field—

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.190
The challenge I had in mind...

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.110
is studying!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.070
Studying?

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:47.040
Y-Yeah. Let's settle this in the next midterm test.
If you pass, then you win, Sun-chan.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:54.170
A-And if you fail,
then I win or something like that.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.920
I see!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:11:00.470
If Sun-chan is going to win,
then the three of us had better...

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.430
study together like we used to!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.680
So that's what this is.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.350
I'm leaving.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.020
What? Wait!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.530
Sun-chan, don't go!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.780
Move, Himawari.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.780
I can't accept this challenge.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:31.040
<i>No good? Figures. Me and Sun-chan...</i>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:35.460
<i>If you're like how you are now
and honestly tell them how you feel,</i>

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.670
<i>I'm sure they'll understand.</i>

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.300
I... I...

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.890
Sun-chan, I want to be friends again...

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:49.180
friends again...

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.690
Wh-What?!

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.190
I want to hang out like we used to!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:56.270
I want to be friends again! Friends!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.820
Me, too! I want to be friends again!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:58.780
Friends again!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.610
Friends again!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.360
- Friends again!
- Friends again!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.070
D-Don't you guys have any pride?!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.200
I don't care about pride!

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.580
All I want is to be friends again!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.950
Friends again!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.170
Sometimes you don't know
what you got until it's gone.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.170
Sun-chan...

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.590
I'm sorry for a lot of things.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:32.520
All right! Together again!
We're all together again!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:37.150
Look, Himawari, I did you wrong, too.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.480
It's okay!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.860
Let's all go back to class together!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.990
- Yeah.
- Yep.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:44.990
All right!

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.490
Hey, Pansy!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.370
School's out, so here I am at the library!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.000
I'm glad it went well for you.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.830
It did! I made up
with Himawari and Sun-chan.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.800
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:03.300
So, Pansy, there's one thing I want to ask you.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.220
Oh, what is it?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.010
Ask me anything.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:10.470
NATSUME SOUSEKI
HAND-WRITTEN ESSAY
KOKORO

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:11.270
What do you think
of Himawari and Sun-chan?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:15.690
Do you seriously think
I can't detect your odious ulterior motive?

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.230
Fine.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.940
I'll help those two study.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.280
Really?

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:30.240
Yes. It seems if someone has more time,
he'll take me somewhere nice.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.080
Got it.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.750
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.580
All right. Give me a little time.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:42.590
Sure. Incidentally, for our studying,
there is room for one more.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.510
No, this is everyone.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:53.470
She's coming. She's definitely coming.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.140
Come again?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.900
Why, if it isn't Joro!

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.740
Asunaro, what are you up to?

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.820
I visited other classes
to give my Flower Dance survey.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.780
Oh. Good for you.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.120
By the by, what are you doing. Joro?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:19.790
Oh, I'm going to meet Sun-chan
and Himawari in the library.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.050
What's the matter, Joro?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:24.880
She's here.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.930
She must be here!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.350
Crap! I forgot!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.600
Asunaro, see you later!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.850
Wait, Joro!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:44.780
Um, where is she?

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:56.620
He made up with Himawari
and then Sun-chan,

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.160
so I thought
I was going to be next, but...

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.630
<i>Let's see now...</i>

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:08.340
I've been watching.
I've been watching Joro all day, but...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.310
It's true!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.270
After all the reconciliation practice
I've been doing...

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.020
The Great Reconciliation Strategy with Joro
~Garnishing the Cosmos~
-Apologize properly and politely
If he doesn't forgive me, then grovel!
-As an apology, help him study!
I'll do my best!
-Use coincidences, and call out to him!
I-It's embarrassing, but you have to try!
-Eat lunch together! (Feeding each other would be great!)
-How about I swore my eternal allegiance to him?
If it's Joro... Ugh! But we’re rushing into things, Joro!
-Turn in an apology essay (short essay)

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:26.030
<i>Joro, I'm really sorry!</i>

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.990
<i>Hi. Fancy meeting you here.</i>

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.240
<i>W-We can't.
We're in the middle of studying.</i>

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.740
<i>You have food on your face.</i>

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.210
<i>She's doing a romantic comedy
with a nonliving object!</i>

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.420
Joro just doesn't care about me.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:47.590
Th-That's not true! I do care!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.130
Joro?

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:54.180
O-Obviously I wanted to make up!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:58.640
You know what they say!
Saving the best for last!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.730
You mean it?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.810
Of course!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.610
Liar!

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.940
The Joro I know would've been like,

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:12.780
"I came here to make up with you,
Sakura-tan! All this time! Wish!"

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.700
That's what you'd say!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.530
What Joro is that?!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.040
You're angry after all!

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.460
You don't care about me!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:33.090
I came here to make up with you,
Sakura-tan! All this time! Wish!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.060
That's the Joro I know!

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.190
Next, do the thing
where you slam your hand into the wall,

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:46.610
brush your fingers through my hair,
and stare into my eyes.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.730
It goes on?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.070
Yoo-hoo, Pansy!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.530
Hello, Pansy.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.030
Hello, Hinata and Akino.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:07.170
Good for you, Joro.
You reconciled with all of them.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.460
Hello, Oga.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.260
Um, Sanshokuin...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.590
I'm very sorry for everything.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.470
It's fine. I'm not worried.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.310
But I...

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.600
Didn't do anything to me, so it's all right.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.400
Thank you!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.190
Why is she nice to everybody but me?

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.950
Well, should we start studying
for the midterm?

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:38.200
At first, the idea was
for me and Pansy to tutor you, but...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:44.910
Joro, I thought this might happen,
so this upperclassman prepared for it.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.120
Therefore, leave it to me.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:53.130
Hey, Joro, Cosmos is really smart, isn't she?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.800
Yeah, I heard she's always been
at the top of her class.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.050
I envy you!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.890
It's not a big deal.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.310
If you study the way I do,
you'll get there, too.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.770
So let's start with math.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.610
For math, the best thing to do
is solve problems

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:12.730
and memorize equations
and problem patterns.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.070
I see.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.150
So...

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.660
your assignment is solving 5,000 problems!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.410
I've got them here!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.960
Um, President Cosmos.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.120
Yes, Joro?

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.540
All 5,000 problems?

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.130
That's right. All 5,000.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.630
To do today?

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.260
Correct. Today.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.880
Isn't that insane?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.350
You're funny, Joro!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.020
No, I've got nothing on you.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:48.940
So get started!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.100
Akino...

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:54.400
I'm going to teach
modern Japanese to Hinata.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:59.660
Yeah! Pansy is going to teach me!
I want to do Japanese!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:03.620
That makes sense. You should start
with the subject of your choice.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.910
Okay. I'll let you take over, Pansy.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.870
All right.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:12.040
<i>This is bad. What's Sun-chan going to do?</i>

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.710
Yoga.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:18.550
<i>He's prepared to meet his fate
and readying his soul to move on!</i>

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.010
All right, let's get started!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.350
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.970
Go easy on us, please.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:31.690
I learned so much today!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.020
Thank you, Pansy!

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.900
You're welcome, Hinata.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:39.780
And the cookies you had as a reward
were delicious!

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.910
They were exquisite, weren't they?

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.910
Would you be willing to share the recipe?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.700
Sure. I don't mind, Akino.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.750
I'll do my best
so I can get another reward tomorrow!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.040
Sun-chan.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.090
You could've had some of Pansy's cookies, too.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:02.800
Nah. I'm more of a skewered-meat guy
than a cookie guy.

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.430
Sun-chan.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.770
All right! I'll prepare 8,000 questions
for English study tomorrow!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:14.230
Hinata, let's continue
with our studies tomorrow.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.770
Yeah! Thank you, Pansy!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.440
What's this?

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:25.160
What's on your mind when you
stare at us with that lecherous smile?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.740
Shut up. I just happened
to be looking that way.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.660
Oh?

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.370
I see.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.380
Sun-chan, I learned a lot of kanji today!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.130
I may get a better score than you
on the midterm!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.590
What?

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.970
I'm not going to let you beat me!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.340
Then it's a competition!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.890
I accept the challenge!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.180
You won't beat me!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.220
That's my line!

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.850
<i>I never imagined
things would turn out like this.</i>

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.700
<i>This is the game changer!</i>

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>Now that we're all friends again, it just hit me!</i>

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.870
<i>This is the beginning of a new ambition!</i>

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.620
<i>Did you think a hard-working man like me
would give up</i>

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.000
<i>with beautiful girls right in front of me?!</i>

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.330
<i>Too bad! I haven't given up in the least!</i>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:22.720
<i>After all, if I keep chasing
the dream that I believe in...</i>

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:26.260
<i>it'll come true eventually!</i>

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.900
<i>If things keep moving smoothly,
this is where I'll end up.</i>

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:37.610
Let's hurry and get home!

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:40.610
What are you doing, Joro?

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.610
If you dilly-dally, we'll leave you here!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.780
Honestly, what are we going to do with him?

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.660
Yeah, whatever. One of these days...

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.210
SCHOOL NEWSPAPER

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.710
KING OF THE SCUMBAGS,
AMATSUYU KISARAGI

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.710
PUTTING THE MOVES
ON THREE WOMEN

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
EPISODE 05
I THOUGHT IT WAS WORKING OUT
TOO WELL FOR ME.

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:39.440
I Thought It Was
Working Out Too Well for Me.
